# NOTE: out/ is intentionally NOT ignored. We pre-build the portfolio locally
# (via `npm run build:portfolio`) and commit `portfolio/out/` so Hostinger
# doesn't need to run `next build` — it ships into server/public/portfolio/
# via copy-portfolio.js as part of the root `npm run build`.
# .next/ stays ignored — it's only used during `next build` itself.
